# [Icebreaker: Getting Outdoors]{color=#007A00}

@body

- Share your name and [*favorite outdoor activity*]{color=#C80085}.
  - Walking, biking, hiking, fishing, birdwatching, playing sports, gardening, or having a picnic.
  - Sitting outside with a book or spending time with friends counts, too!
- [*Where do you like to go?*]{color=#007A00} Busse Woods, a neighborhood park, your backyard, or somewhere else?
