# Microbes #1: Z-test

@right

- Soil microbes in nearby Busse Woods.
- Concerns about urbanization and biodiversity.
- Shannon Index values describe microbial diversity.
- *The comparison:* Average diversity vs. a benchmark for similar ecosystems.

@left

![Microbes 1: schematic test comparison](assets/tutorial_overviews/microbes_1.svg)

