=== layout: section

# Group Project

=== layout: one-panel

# Joining the Group Project

@body

- *Goal:* Build a statistics tutorial that classmates can follow.
- *Your team:* 1 graduate student + 3 undergraduates; groups form Nov 4.
- *Your contribution:* Help choose a topic, develop example data, and write and check the tutorial steps.
- *Start together:* Use existing course tutorials as models; prepare your group proposal for Nov 11.
- *Test and improve:* Classmates try the tutorial; your group revises it using their feedback.
- *Final tutorial package:* Due Dec 16.

@notes

Project purpose and workflow: biol_318-biostatistics/CURE_summer_course/capstone_scaffold.txt.
Dates and team composition: current Fall 2026 biostats SCHEDULE.md.
Undergraduate contributions summarize the shared project work, not separately graded roles.
Do not infer project point values or a grading rubric from the planning scaffold.

